#: ../../source/docs/common-mro-uavcan-adapter-node.rst:5
#: c25e3499928c46559580f320b40fdd19
msgid "mRobotics DroneCAN Adapter Node"
msgstr "mRobotics DroneCAN 适配器节点"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mro-uavcan-adapter-node.rst:8
#: 763131de16454d43a1753fd01edaf8f8
msgid ""
"The mRo CAN Node is a collaborative project with ArduPilot. It began with a "
"desire to make CAN peripherals more standard in the drone community. "
"Compared to other boards that have open-source hardware but closed source "
"code, mRo CAN node is completely open. The CAN Node F303 is the version 2 of"
" mRobotics' CAN Node, featuring more flash space."
msgstr ""
"mRo CAN 节点是与 ArduPilot 合作的项目，最初源于使无人机社区 CAN "
"外设更加标准化的愿望。与其他拥有开源硬件但闭源代码的控制板相比，mRo CAN 节点完全开放。CAN Node F303 是 mRobotics CAN"
" 节点的第 2 版，提供了更大的 Flash 空间。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mro-uavcan-adapter-node.rst:10
#: 59fe755b05274cbdadd01c19b8eeaab2
msgid ""
"With this board, you can easily utilize the ArduPilot driver library to "
"convert ArduPilot supported GPS, I2C, and GPIO based (ie Safety Switch) "
"peripherals to DroneCAN bus peripherals."
msgstr ""
"使用该控制板，你可以轻松利用 ArduPilot 驱动程序库，将 ArduPilot 支持的 GPS、I2C 和基于 GPIO "
"的外设（如安全开关）转换为 DroneCAN 总线外设。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mro-uavcan-adapter-node.rst:15
#: 6c25a3831fc9487095726bede08d8805
msgid ""
"mRo CAN Node uses open-source code, which utilizes the existing and proven "
"ArduPilot DroneCAN driver library (see :ref:`DroneCAN Adapter Nodes <common-"
"uavcan-adapter-node>` for firmware versions and capabilities). It features a"
"  bootloader for \"over CAN\" firmware updates and an RTOS running Chibios."
msgstr ""
"mRo CAN 节点使用开源代码，利用现有且经过验证的 ArduPilot DroneCAN 驱动程序库（固件版本和功能请参见 "
":ref:`DroneCAN 适配器节点 <common-uavcan-adapter-node>`）。它具有用于「CAN "
"空中」固件更新的引导程序和运行 Chibios 的 RTOS。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mro-uavcan-adapter-node.rst:17
#: efffaa5750e3400fb523bce626b5b2ac
msgid ""
"The adapter's CAN Node ID can be set manually or automatically (Not yet "
"supported in stable ArduPilot). The hardware design is open source, so that "
"anyone can contribute to the CAN peripheral world with a proven CAN / MCU "
"interface."
msgstr ""
"适配器的 CAN 节点 ID 可以手动设置或自动设置（ArduPilot 稳定版尚不支持）。硬件设计开源，任何人都可以通过经过验证的 CAN/MCU "
"接口为 CAN 外设生态做出贡献。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mro-uavcan-adapter-node.rst:19
#: 772d3ed917c541809f6448f186c1d991
msgid ""
"As delivered, it is setup to be plug-and-play as a DroneCAN "
"GPS/Magnetometer/LED/Airspeed by simply plugging in the 6pin GH connector "
"from any mRo or other GPS, and connecting I2C Compasses, RGB LEDs, and/or "
"Airspeed sensors supported by ArduPilot, as desired."
msgstr ""
"出厂时即可即插即用，只需插入来自任何 mRo 或其他 GPS 的 6 针 GH 连接器，并根据需要连接 ArduPilot 支持的 I2C 罗盘、RGB"
" LED 和/或空速传感器，即可作为 DroneCAN GPS/磁力计/LED/空速计使用。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mro-uavcan-adapter-node.rst:21
#: ff59b92743e0402d96cce6161e2e90d6
msgid ""
"This adapter uses the \"f303-GPS\" or \"f303-Universal\" (default) firmware "
"in https://firmware.ardupilot.org/AP_Periph. See the :ref:`SLCAN section of "
"DroneCAN advanced setup<common-uavcan-setup-advanced>` for downloading "
"instructions, if changes are desired or updates become available."
msgstr ""
"该适配器使用 https://firmware.ardupilot.org/AP_Periph "
"中的「f303-GPS」或「f303-Universal」（默认）固件。如需更改或有更新可用，请参阅 :ref:`DroneCAN 高级设置的 "
"SLCAN 部分 <common-uavcan-setup-advanced>` 获取下载说明。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mro-uavcan-adapter-node.rst:24
#: 74ff950038f6426fb9d365a8be420ba0
msgid "Setup"
msgstr "配置"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mro-uavcan-adapter-node.rst:26
#: 8ed8cb65de7e488a8e503a543052eaab
msgid ""
"Verify the following parameters are set on your autopilot via your ground "
"station."
msgstr "通过地面站在飞控上确认以下参数已正确设置。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mro-uavcan-adapter-node.rst:28
#: b60ddb43b76b482e899e867a48a345e9
msgid ""
":ref:`CAN_P1_DRIVER<CAN_P1_DRIVER>` = 1 (assuming its on the first CAN bus "
"of the autopilot and will be using the first driver)"
msgstr ""
":ref:`CAN_P1_DRIVER<CAN_P1_DRIVER>` = 1（假设连接到飞控的第一条 CAN 总线，并使用第一个驱动程序）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mro-uavcan-adapter-node.rst:29
#: 7a86c38f76ce440e899f04f80bed7a97
msgid ""
":ref:`CAN_D1_PROTOCOL<CAN_D1_PROTOCOL>` = 1 (DroneCAN)(assuming its the "
"first driver)"
msgstr ":ref:`CAN_D1_PROTOCOL<CAN_D1_PROTOCOL>` = 1（DroneCAN）（假设使用第一个驱动程序）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mro-uavcan-adapter-node.rst:30
#: afca1aa0b5074af48ba707318d1ce5cc
msgid ""
":ref:`GPS1_TYPE<GPS1_TYPE>` = 9 (DroneCAN) or if it will be the secondary "
"GPS, set instead"
msgstr ":ref:`GPS1_TYPE<GPS1_TYPE>` = 9（DroneCAN），如果作为辅助 GPS 则改设"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mro-uavcan-adapter-node.rst:31
#: 5281baffc84e4b1b96026eadb403e777
msgid ":ref:`GPS2_TYPE<GPS2_TYPE>` = 9 (DroneCAN)"
msgstr ":ref:`GPS2_TYPE<GPS2_TYPE>` = 9（DroneCAN）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mro-uavcan-adapter-node.rst:32
#: 773571c400f44625824f6b031d967c78
msgid "Reboot"
msgstr "重启"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mro-uavcan-adapter-node.rst:34
#: 0907c9ea7bc94f00b34370e8b8f8ff03
msgid ""
"Make sure the DroneCAN compass driver is not disabled. "
"(:ref:`COMPASS_DISBLMSK<COMPASS_DISBLMSK>` bit 9 should not be set)."
msgstr ""
"确保 DroneCAN 罗盘驱动未被禁用。（:ref:`COMPASS_DISBLMSK<COMPASS_DISBLMSK>` 的第 9 "
"位不应被设置）。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mro-uavcan-adapter-node.rst:36
#: 57fcd938cc5d4962bd11b9144a72e8c6
msgid ""
"If your controller has multiple compasses attached already, you may want to "
"set the attached compass as a higher priority than others, if it has better "
"precision or performance."
msgstr "如果飞控上已连接多个罗盘，且该罗盘精度或性能更佳，可以将其优先级设置高于其他罗盘。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mro-uavcan-adapter-node.rst:38
#: 7e774d015323485a95de702b8d2b9608
msgid "To enable an attached I2C RGB LED set:"
msgstr "启用外接 I2C RGB LED，请设置："

#: ../../source/docs/common-mro-uavcan-adapter-node.rst:40
#: 715c5a56e0c541f092b5bbf3c294f1e3
msgid ":ref:`NTF_LED_TYPES<NTF_LED_TYPES>` bit 5 should be set"
msgstr "应设置 :ref:`NTF_LED_TYPES<NTF_LED_TYPES>` 的第 5 位"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mro-uavcan-adapter-node.rst:42
#: 312163778c0c40da83b0792dadaf1947
msgid "If you want to enable an attached I2C airspeed sensor, set:"
msgstr "如需启用外接 I2C 空速传感器，请设置："

#: ../../source/docs/common-mro-uavcan-adapter-node.rst:44
#: bcabd02c050949ca86dfec00a9f3140d
msgid ":ref:`ARSPD_TYPE<ARSPD_TYPE>` = 8 (DroneCAN)"
msgstr ":ref:`ARSPD_TYPE<ARSPD_TYPE>` = 8（DroneCAN）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mro-uavcan-adapter-node.rst:46
#: 0a56dbd3a63f4f008c9d0c1ca459b3f9
msgid ""
"Then you must access your Adapter's CAN parameters to select Airspeed and "
"LED type being attached to the adapter. Using Mission Planner (or "
":ref:`common-uavcan-gui`), go to the menu SETUP/Optional "
"Hardware/DroneCAN/SLCan Mode CAN1/Parameters. Once the CAN Adapters "
"parameters appear, change the following (this changes them inside the "
"DroneCAN adapter, NOT the autopilot, allowing the adapter to use the correct"
" driver and convert the information to DroneCAN airspeed format):"
msgstr ""
"然后必须访问适配器的 CAN 参数以选择连接到适配器的空速传感器和 LED 类型。通过 Mission Planner（或 :ref:`common-"
"uavcan-gui`），进入 SETUP/Optional Hardware/DroneCAN/SLCan Mode CAN1/Parameters "
"菜单。CAN 适配器参数出现后，更改以下内容（这是在 DroneCAN 适配器内部修改，而非飞控，以便适配器使用正确的驱动程序并将信息转换为 "
"DroneCAN 空速格式）："

#: ../../source/docs/common-mro-uavcan-adapter-node.rst:48
#: 9758dc9a56a64d84bab3a1f82c9ee7a9
msgid ""
":ref:`ARSPD_TYPE<ARSPD_TYPE>` = to match your sensor type: 3,for an "
"I2C-MS5525; 1 for an MS4525DO, etc."
msgstr ""
":ref:`ARSPD_TYPE<ARSPD_TYPE>` = 根据传感器类型设置：3 用于 I2C-MS5525；1 用于 MS4525DO，等等。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mro-uavcan-adapter-node.rst:49
#: ca0f56ea3a3d4fea94e1b360ae4d3bd7
msgid ":ref:`ARSPD_USE<ARSPD_USE>` =  1"
msgstr ":ref:`ARSPD_USE<ARSPD_USE>` = 1"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mro-uavcan-adapter-node.rst:50
#: a1c79eb0d0cf4aa18db171bb3915e491
msgid ":ref:`ARSPD_BUS<ARSPD_BUS>` =  0"
msgstr ":ref:`ARSPD_BUS<ARSPD_BUS>` = 0"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mro-uavcan-adapter-node.rst:52
#: 70e53bb046484866a5bd7bae9d14835b
msgid ""
"For the LED, set its :ref:`NTF_LED_TYPES<NTF_LED_TYPES>` appropriately for "
"the attached LED."
msgstr "对于 LED，根据所接 LED 类型适当设置其 :ref:`NTF_LED_TYPES<NTF_LED_TYPES>`。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mro-uavcan-adapter-node.rst:54
#: 6a1d070c533f458fbcfaaa70adc7299d
msgid "Then reboot."
msgstr "然后重启。"

